case-studies\">Our Case Studies</a></li>\n      \n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"d-none d-lg-block\">\n          <a href=\"#ready-to-light\" class=\"primary-btn text-decoration-none\">Contact Us</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n\n</header>\n<!-- Header Ends Here -->\n\n    <!-- Hero Section -->\n    <section id=\"hero\" class=\"py-6 bg-white\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n          \n          <!-- Left Column: Text -->\n          <div class=\"col-lg-7 mb-4 mb-lg-0 position-relative\">\n            <!-- Icon -->\n            <div class=\"position-absolute d-lg-flex d-none  \" style=\"z-index: 5; top: -6px; left: -6px;\">\n              <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/hero-icon-d.svg\" alt=\"\">\n              </div>\n    \n            <!-- Heading -->\n            <h1 class=\"fw-bold display-4 text-center text-lg-start font-montserrat\">\n              Boost Your <span class=\"text-purple\">Business</span><br>\n              <small class=\"fw-normal d-block text-dark mt-2 fs-1\">with Proven Digital Strategies</small>\n            </h1>\n    \n            <!-- Description -->\n            <p class=\"fs-6 muted text-lg-start text-center mt-3\">\n              Maximize your online presence with expert SEO, targeted ads, and high-converting content.\n              Let’s create a strategy that drives real results for your business!\n            </p>\n    \n            <!-- Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"mt-4 d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-content-center justify-content-lg-start\">\n              <button class=\"primary-btn\">  Book a FREE Consultation</button>\n              \n              \n              <button class=\"secondary-btn\">Learn More</button>\n            \n           \n            </div>\n          </div>\n    \n          <!-- Right Column: Images Grid -->\n        <!-- Right Column: Overlapping Image Collage -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-5 position-relative d-flex justify-content-center mt-4 mt-lg-0\">\n  <div class=\"position-relative\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 320px;\">\n\n    <!-- Image 1 -->\n    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/Digital Agency 1.png\" class=\"rounded shadow position-absolute\" style=\"top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 1; width: 300px;\" alt=\"Image 1\">\n\n    <!-- Image 2 -->\n    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/Untitled design-6.png\" class=\"rounded shadow position-absolute d-lg-flex d-none\" style=\"top: 160px; right: -70px; z-index: 2; width: 150px;\" alt=\"Image 2\">\n\n    <!-- Image 3 -->\n    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/Untitled design-7.png\" class=\"rounded shadow position-absolute d-lg-flex d-none\" style=\"top: 150px; left: 10px; z-index: 1; width: 182px;\" alt=\"Image 3\">\n\n    <!-- Top-right icon -->\n    <div class=\"position-absolute d-lg-flex d-none  shadow\" style=\"z-index: 5; top: 110px; right: -50px;\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/hero-icon-b.svg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Bottom-left icon -->\n    <div class=\"position-absolute d-lg-flex d-none p-2\" style=\"z-index: 5; bottom: 10px; left: -40px;\">\n      <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/hero-icon-a.svg\" alt=\"\">\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n     <!-- Hero Section Ends Here -->\n\n    <!-- About Us  -->\n    <section class=\"about-section py-6\" id=\"about-us\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n            <!-- Left Text Column -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-6 about-text\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <h2 class=\"fs-2 font-montserrat fw-bold text-black text-md-start text-center\">About Us</h2>\n              <p class=\"fs-6 muted text-md-start text-center\">We specialize in data-driven digital marketing that helps businesses grow, attract more customers, and increase revenue. With years of experience in SEO, PPC, social media, and content marketing, we craft tailored strategies that deliver real, measurable results.</p>\n              <p class=\"fs-6 muted text-md-start text-center\">Our mission is simple: to help businesses like yours succeed in the digital world. Whether you\'re looking to boost website traffic, improve lead generation, or build a strong online brand, we provide expert solutions that drive long-term success.</p>\n            </div>\n    \n            <!-- Right Image Column -->\n            <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n              <div class=\"image-container\">\n                <div class=\"purple-box d-md-block d-none\"></div>\n                <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/about-us.png\" alt=\"Team Image\" class=\"main-image img-fluid\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    <!-- About Us Ends Here -->\n\n    <!-- Partners   -->\n    <section class=\"brand-logos text-center py-6\" id=\"partners\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center g-4\">\n            <div class=\"col-4 col-sm-2\">\n              <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/partner-a.svg\" alt=\"Slack\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-4 col-sm-2\">\n              <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/partner-b.svg\" alt=\"Amazon\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-4 col-sm-2\">\n              <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/partner-c.svg\" alt=\"Logitech\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-4 col-sm-2\">\n              <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/partner-d.svg\" alt=\"Google\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-4 col-sm-2\">\n              <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/partner-e.svg\" alt=\"Facebook\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    <!-- Partners Ends Here  -->\n\n    <!-- Our Services  -->\n    <section id=\"our-services\" class=\"py-6\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row align-items-start\">\n            <!-- Left Column: Heading and Description -->\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6 mb-4\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <h2 class=\" font-montserrat fs-2 fw-bold text-black mb-3 text-md-start text-center\">Our Services</h2>\n              <p class=\"fs-6 muted mb-5 text-md-start text-center\">\n                We provide data-driven digital marketing solutions designed to grow your business. From increasing website traffic with SEO to driving sales through PPC, we create strategies tailored to your goals. Our social media marketing helps build brand awareness, and content marketing establishes credibility. Plus, with analytics &amp; conversion optimization, we ensure every campaign delivers measurable results.\n              </p>\n              \n              <!-- Image grid -->\n              <div class=\"row g-3\">\n                <div class=\"col-4 position-relative\">\n                  <div class=\"purple-bg-box d-md-block d-none\"></div>\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/services-a.png\" alt=\"Service 1\" class=\"img-fluid position-relative\" style=\"z-index: 2; border-radius: 8px;\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-4 position-relative\">\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/services-b.png\" alt=\"Service 2\" class=\"img-fluid position-relative\" style=\" z-index: 2; border-radius: 8px;;\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-4\">\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/services-c.png\" alt=\"Service 3\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; z-index: 2;\">\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n      \n            <!-- Right Column: Service List -->\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <div class=\"d-flex mb-md-5 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"me-3 service-icon\">\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/service-icon-d.svg\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <h5 class=\"fw-semibold\">Social Media Marketing</h5>\n                  <p class=\"mb-0 fs-6 muted\">Engage and grow your audience with strategic content, ads, and brand positioning across Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, and more.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n      \n              <div class=\"d-flex  mb-md-5 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"me-3 service-icon\">\n                    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/service-icon-b.svg\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <h5 class=\"fw-semibold\">Content Marketing</h5>\n                  <p class=\"mb-0 fs-6 muted\">Attract and convert customers with compelling blog posts, website copy, case studies, guides, and email marketing campaigns.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n      \n              <div class=\"d-flex mb-md-5 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"me-3 service-icon\">\n                    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/service-icon-c.svg\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <h5 class=\"fw-semibold\">SEO &amp; SEM Optimization</h5>\n                  <p class=\"mb-0 fs-6 muted\">Boost your website\'s search engine rankings with expert keyword strategies, on-page optimization, and high-quality backlinks.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n      \n              <div class=\"d-flex\">\n                <div class=\"me-3 service-icon\">\n                    <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/service-icon-a.svg\" alt=\"\">\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <h5 class=\"fw-semibold\">PPC (Pay-Per-Click Advertising)</h5>\n                  <p class=\"mb-0 fs-6 muted\">Maximize ROI with targeted Google Ads and social media campaigns that drive high-quality traffic and conversions.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n        <!-- Our Services Ends Here -->\n\n    <!-- Stats  -->\n    <section id=\"stats\" class=\"py-6 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n          <div class=\"row text-center justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-3 mb-4\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <h3 class=\"fw-bold\">₹2M+</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Ad Revenue Generated</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-3 mb-4\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <h3 class=\"fw-bold\">300+</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Successful Campaigns</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-3 mb-4\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <h3 class=\"fw-bold\">10+</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Countries Served</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-6 col-sm-3 mb-4\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <h3 class=\"fw-bold\">500%</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-muted mb-0\">Increase in Website Traffic</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n        <!-- Stats Ends Here -->\n\n    <!-- Case Studies  -->\n    <section id=\"case-studies\" class=\"py-6 \">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center flex-column flex-sm-row mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\" font-montserrat fs-2 fw-bold text-black text-md-start text-center\">Our Case Studies</h2>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"primary-btn\">Explore All Projects</button>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"fs-6 muted mb-0 text-md-start text-center mb-4\">We’ve helped businesses achieve remarkable growth through tailored digital marketing strategies. From tripling website traffic with SEO to boosting ad ROI by 4X, our data-driven approach delivers real results. Our success stories showcase increased leads, higher conversions, and stronger brand presence across various industries.</p>\n    \n        <!-- Swiper Container -->\n        <div class=\"swiper caseStudiesSwiper d-md-none swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal\">\n          <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\" id=\"swiper-wrapper-31fd701b044224ac\" aria-live=\"polite\" style=\"transition-duration: 0ms;\">\n    \n            <!-- Card 1 -->\n            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n              \n            <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n                <div class=\"zoom-container\">\n\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/case-a.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"Sneaker\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\n                  <span class=\"card-span-purple fw-semibold small\">Fashion</span>\n                  <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-2\">\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mt-2\">High-Performance Sneaker Brand\n                    </h5>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-dark hover-scale text-decoration-none ms-2\" title=\"View Case Study\">\n                      <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\"></i>\n                    </a>\n                  </div>\n                  \n                  <p class=\"card-text text-muted\">A sneaker brand focused on high-performance shoes for athletes was struggling to differentiate its products in a saturated market and boost sales among competitive runners.</p>\n                </div>\n              </div></div>\n    \n            <!-- Card 2 -->\n            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n              \n            <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n                <div class=\"zoom-container\">\n\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/case-b.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"Sneaker\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\n                  <span class=\"card-span-purple fw-semibold small\">Game</span>\n                  <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-2\">\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mt-2\">Game Console Brand\n                    </h5>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-dark hover-scale text-decoration-none ms-2\" title=\"View Case Study\">\n                      <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\"></i>\n                    </a>\n                  </div>\n                  <p class=\"card-text text-muted\">A new game console brand wanted to generate buzz and excitement ahead of its product launch, targeting both casual gamers and hardcore gaming communities.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div></div>\n    \n            <!-- Card 3 -->\n            <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n              \n            <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n                <div class=\"zoom-container\">\n\n                  <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/case-c.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"Sneaker\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"card-body\">\n                  <span class=\"card-span-purple fw-semibold small\">Food</span>\n                  <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-2\">\n                    <h5 class=\"card-title mt-2\">Canned Tomato Soup Brand\n                    </h5>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-dark hover-scale text-decoration-none ms-2\" title=\"View Case Study\">\n                      <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\"></i>\n                    </a>\n                  </div>\n                  <p class=\"card-text text-muted\">A well-known canned soup brand wanted to revitalize its image and appeal to health-conscious millennials while staying true to its classic, comforting roots.\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n              </div></div>\n    \n          </div>\n          <!-- Swiper Pagination -->\n          <div class=\"swiper-pagination mt-3 swiper-pagination-clickable swiper-pagination-bullets swiper-pagination-horizontal\"></div>\n        <span class=\"swiper-notification\" aria-live=\"assertive\" aria-atomic=\"true\"></span></div>\n    \n        <!-- Desktop Grid -->\n        <div class=\"row d-none d-md-flex\">\n          <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"card border-0  shadow-sm h-100\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <div class=\"zoom-container\">\n\n                <img src=\"https://static.zigrow.com/digital-marketing/assets/image/case-a.png\" class=\"card-img-top\" alt=\"Sneaker\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"card-body\">\n                <span class=\"card-span-purple fw-semibold small\">Fashion</span>\n                <div class=\"d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-2\">\n                  <h5 class=\"card-title mt-2\">High-Performance Sneaker Brand</h5>\n                  <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-dark hover-scale text-decoration-none ms-2\" title=\"View Case Study\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up-right-from-square\"></i>\n                  </a>\n                </div>\n                \n                \n         \n                <p class=\"card-text text-muted\">A sneaker brand focused on high-performance shoes for athletes was struggling to differentiate its products in a saturated market and boost sales among competitive runners.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4\">\n            <div class=\"card border-0 shadow-sm h-100\" style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; opacity: 1; transform: translate(0px, 0px);\">\n              <div class=